    {
      "id": "claim_24334f49c99d4a669556a487b170592c",
      "statement": "InterestScoringSweep runs on a fixed delay/initial delay (myfeeder.interest.sweep-delay/sweep-initial-delay), enqueues at most min(ScoringQueue.remainingCapacity(), sweep-batch-size) ids newest-first per run, and skips entirely when Jev is unconfigured, the jev circuit breaker is OPEN or FORCED_OPEN, or the app is in cold start; it still runs while the breaker is HALF_OPEN, relying on the breaker's automatic OPEN-to-HALF_OPEN transition to resume scoring on its own.",
